ected parts of the account.","“Gardeners gather plant scraps into a heap.” is true but covers one part only.","“Give a beginning player a cue for their own part.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Hang bags on hooks to leave reading seats free.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Hear the whole message before deciding what to do.” applies to both characters’ different mistakes and repairs.","“Hooks carry some seeds on animal fur.” is true but covers a different part only.","“Keep clean paper pieces for another group to use.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Keep drainage holes clear when caring for plants.” fits only the other episode.","“Keep the magnifier on its labelled shelf.” is useful in episode 1, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 2.","“Large eyes help owls see in dim light.” is true but covers one part only.","“Learning a stitch can help mend a costume.” fits only the other episode.","“Light and position change a toy’s shadow.” covers the connected parts of the account.","“Light wings carry some seeds on wind.” is true but covers one part only.","“Look carefully beneath a stopped toy car to find what is blocking its wheels.” fits only one episode.","“Look inside a bag before deciding it is empty.” is useful in episode 1, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 2.","“Make every paper fold carefully to avoid tearing a wing on the bird.” fits only one episode.","“Make name labels so visitors can identify display pictures.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Measuring string can help a model fit.” fits only the other episode.","“Move a plant into another pot when its pot breaks.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Move one light panel to try a scenery job.” is useful in episode 1, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 2.","“Moving a toy nearer makes larger shadows.” is true but covers a different part only.","“Moving the torch sideways shifts the shadow.” is true but covers one part only.","“Name a door and its nearby landmark for a visitor.” is useful in episode 1, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 2.","“Name an object and its shelf when asking for it.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Offer a number of decorations you have time to finish.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Offer backstage jobs to children who prefer them.” fits only the other episode.","“Oiled outer feathers help swimming ducks stay dry.” is true but covers a different part only.","“Pause at important points to avoid repeating errors.” applies to both characters’ different mistakes and repairs.","“Pond plants give adult frogs hiding places.” is true but covers one part only.","“Pond water holds frog eggs and young.” is true but covers a different part only.","“Ponds meet frogs’ needs through their lives.” covers the connected parts of the account.","“Practise a game’s goal with a child who is new.” is useful in episode 1, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 2.","“Put a large model on a table away from a doorway.” is useful in episode 1, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 2.","“Put game counters back in their own game box.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Put the event banner beside your bag the night before.” is useful in episode 2, but does not cover the different problem and correction in episode 1.","“Repair a loose wheel before decorating a working cart.” is useful in episo